  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Successor Program - ASEAN-Australia Political Security Partnership (APSP2)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The successor program to the ASEAN-Australia Political Security Partnership (APSP2) builds on the work undertaken under APSP1 (2019-2026). The program supports ASEAN to address transnational crime, maritime security, and to strengthen regional resilience. It  will also support deeper Australia engagement with ASEAN in these priority areas. APSP2 works with ASEAN sectoral bodies, the ASEAN Secretariat, and Australian government agencies through ASEAN mechanisms and endorsed activities  such as regional dialogue, workshops, trainings,  and research.</narrative>
  </description>
